WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Nordwind — one real day. Scenario; the weather part runs live.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Field staff fill in the signed template “Törn-Briefing Samstag Bremen” on an Android phone.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The installation is saved in the account.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.700
HQ Hamburg runs it in the sandbox with its own Claude plan.

5
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:31.000
Workshop GPU and harbour office join in over encrypted, outbound-only channels. The edge sees nothing.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.500
The real briefing returns to the phone.

7
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:45.000
Real run for Bremen (German output): “Für fünf Tage bleibt es trocken, was Outdoor-Aktivitäten wie Segeln begünstigt.”
